h_text","block_id":"flf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9db2baa0-0749-4308-9581-0653fbccf0b6","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"あ","ts":"1622077665.145800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"To3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04b257ad-e283-495f-ad1e-f83c7bfa01c2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なんで、dps-fooで普通のプラグインでいうVimEnterのタイミングで処理を噛ましたい場合の話のつもりでした","ts":"1622077660.145600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+X8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96e1545a-8a6a-4f0a-9cf1-5219a415b008","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"そうですね VimEnter *で* 呼ばれるので後になります","ts":"1622077629.144900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zIv=q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9058fc93-a9dd-415d-b338-96ebdd065da6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"denopsが非同期ロードだからdps-fooがVimEnterのあとに読まれません？","ts":"1622077602.144600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KU9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a056e828-1b9e-4020-b6c0-3295c2ceded8","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"？","ts":"1622077583.144000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7e1Qu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dc3a798-628f-4e63-a093-15451c126741","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"了解です、VimEnterで発火しないんでちょっと不便なんですよね","ts":"1622077575.143800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G+TVz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9efd9556-1a84-4d0d-a537-607a4da4df5d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ないですねー","ts":"1622077556.143300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Og8LX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db698a8e-9d95-49f7-b720-cdf35ead1cc4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U776661HA\u003e denopsで各プラグイン実装が起動した瞬間にdoautocmd飛ばすみたいなのってAPIないですよねきっと\n普通にVim scriptレベルで起動の瞬間投げる感じですかね","ts":"1622076661.143100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3kjR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"043a2bde-5451-4fd9-8bc9-c0f038690cd0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"んー、シンプルにneovimにrequestを送って、結果を受け取って返しているだけに見えるな","ts":"1622073956.141500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s34"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f6efb21-f267-4ef9-95fb-eaa9c5376e41","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありすえさん、messagepack自作したのか（すげぇ","ts":"1622073531.140800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bxL8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"557d50d4-a0c8-460d-9980-de33fe1ea3f7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttp://frsyuki.hatenablog.com/entry/20100406/p1\u003e\nmessagepack rpcの仕組みをみつつ","ts":"1622073284.140300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Blog by Sadayuki Furuhashi: MessagePack-RPCのプロトコル仕様（ドラフト）と実装例 - Blog by Sadayuki Furuhashi","id":1,"title":"MessagePack-RPCのプロトコル仕様（ドラフト）と実装例 - Blog by Sadayuki Furuhashi","title_link":"http://frsyuki.hatenablog.com/entry/20100406/p1","text":"以前に書いた MessagePack RPC プロトコル は少し古くなってしまったので、ここでまとめ直しておこうと思います。 MessagePack-RPCのプロトコルは、非同期型の呼び出しができる点（非同期プロトコル）が大きな特徴となっています。複数のサーバが相互に通信し合ったり、通信と計算をオーバーラップさせて高速化を図ったりするような、高度なネットワークアプリケーションを実装しやすくなります。 RPCライブラリと言うよりも、シンプルな非同期メッセージングライブラリと言えます。 ここではMessagePack-RPCのプロトコル仕様と、以上の特徴を活かせるような実装例も合わせて紹介します。…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/12704538227038607187/12921228815714208124/1386544161","blocks":null,"ts":1270479600,"service_name":"Blog by Sadayuki Furuhashi","service_icon":"http://frsyuki.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"http://frsyuki.hatenablog.com/entry/20100406/p1","original_url":"http://frsyuki.hatenablog.com/entry/20100406/p1"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K98"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc340055-37fc-49aa-b414-df6e1f4868f1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ここ読んで見る","ts":"1622073203.139900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"29Wsj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3518252-7fa5-4b59-9ebf-2e1535645303","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```  async call(fn: string, ...args: unknown[]): Promise\u0026lt;unknown\u0026gt; {\n    return await this.#session.call(\"call\", fn, ...args);\n  }```","ts":"1622073199.139700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rjr1h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a33ca987-cfde-42d3-88c2-23b6057b7339","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"試しに、awaitを使わないで動かしてみたら fn.bufadd Promiseが返ってこないのは確認できた\n```    const denops = new Denops(\"test\", reader, writer);\n    const fn = new FuctionHelper(denops);\n    fn.bufadd(\"denops\").then((bufnr) =\u0026gt; console.log(\"result\", bufnr)).catch((\n      err,\n    ) =\u0026gt; console.log(err));\n\n    await new Promise((resolve) =\u0026gt; setTimeout(resolve, 100 * 1000));```","ts":"1622072559.139200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g2C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45e604ac-4a39-45c1-a2ef-1b04e9e9f5b8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ちゃんとnvim起動しているなぁ\n\n```24836 skanehira  40   0  389G  3456 ?  0.0  0.0  0:00.00    │  │     └─ /bin/zsh\n58770 skanehira  25   0  394G  106M ?  0.0  0.6  0:00.10    │  │        └─ deno test --allow-all --unstable --filter /Function/\n58782 skanehira  25   0     0     0 Z  0.0  0.0  0:00.00    │  │           └─ nvim```","ts":"1622072333.137500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JUcD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae675721-930b-4027-a37b-97ef0e4cbc3b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"denops製プラグインのインポート周り、import_mapsで解決したい気持ちがある\nあれdenoの実行時にファイルの場所指定しないといけないので難しそう","ts":"1622071549.136800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pUtr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d277d147-7ffa-4f0e-9a34-68ae5b75b124","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そのまま移植できないの、なんでだろ","ts":"1622070975.135700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QlL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"073e255a-08dd-4901-a03b-74f02f0658ea","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"denops-denoでは普通に動いたな","ts":"1622070844.135200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=VB9m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c49c2e6f-0588-46d9-811f-b401619d5659","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```MacbookPro13% deno test --allow-all\nrunning 0 tests from file:///Users/skanehira/dev/go/src/github.com/vim-denops/denops-deno/deps_test.ts\nrunning 2 tests from file:///Users/skanehira/dev/go/src/github.com/vim-denops/denops-deno/testutil_test.ts\ntest withNvim start nvim to communicate with ... ok (7ms)\ntest withVim start vim to communicate with ... ok (55ms)\n\ntest result: ok. 2 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out (118ms)\n\nMacbookPro13%```","ts":"1622070831.134900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8XK"}]}]
